The '''Southern Pyrenees''' ({{Langx|bl|Pirineos Sur}}; {{Langx|arn|Nompuehuenu|4=other side of the sky}}) are a major [[W:Mountain range|mountain range]] system of the [[Anhangá Cordillera]], that runs northeast–southwest across the island of [[Tinguiririca]]. 

